  "label": "self-deprecating joke",
  "description": "A self-deprecating joke is a humorous statement in which the speaker makes fun of themselves, often to deflect attention or to create a sense of relatability. This concept is essential to understanding the meme's intent, as the humor relies on the viewer identifying with the tiger's defeat as a metaphor for their own first loss, using self-mockery to lighten the emotional weight.",
